":"ea7e2554-34f9-42f6-ad41-3cb48c7434c1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"eskkの実装が複雑すぎて誰の手にも負えてない件について","ts":"1625829484.303200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gmA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eadad6f-d962-4a5e-96d2-0b93062ceb48","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"つらい \u003chttps://github.com/tyru/nesk.vim|https://github.com/tyru/nesk.vim\u003e","ts":"1625829401.302500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tyru/nesk.vim","id":1,"title":"tyru/nesk.vim","text":"(DOES NOT WORK NOW) Input method framework for Vim. Currently nesk-skk(next version of eskk.vim) is also being developed in this repository","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"4","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NQC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c43c6aad-2f5a-4ccf-86d3-030eac5cbab6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/tyru/eskk.vim/issues/249|https://github.com/tyru/eskk.vim/issues/249\u003e","ts":"1625829353.302100","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/tyru/eskk.vim/issues/249|#249 バッファごとに句読点のスタイルを変更するには？\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/tyru/eskk.vim/issues/249|#249 バッファごとに句読点のスタイルを変更するには？\u003e","text":"質問になってすみません。\n\n文書の種類に応じて異なる句読点のスタイルを用いる必要があって、どうしたものかと思っています。\n\n• 論文のときは `，` と `．`\n• ふつうの文章では `、` と `。`\n\nを使いわけます。  \nで、`eskk#register_mode_table` を使って mode table を変更する方法を知ったため、以下のように `SkkTechnical` と `SkkCasual` というコマンドを用意して、eskk が動く出す前であれば、それ以後、利用する mode table を変更できるようにしています。\n\n```\nlet s:eskk_mode_tables = [                                                 \n      \\ eskk#table#new('rom_to_hira'.'*', 'rom_to_hira'),\n      \\ eskk#table#new('rom_to_kata'.'*', 'rom_to_kata')]                  \n\nfunction! s:eskk_register_mode_table()\n  call eskk#register_mode_table('hira', b:eskk_mode_tables[0])\n  call eskk#register_mode_table('kata', b:eskk_mode_tables[1])\nendfunction\n\nautocmd User eskk-initialize-pre call s:eskk_register_mode_table()\n\nfunction! s:eskk_punctuation(punctuation_mapping)\n  for table in s:eskk_mode_tables\n    for [from, to] in a:punctuation_mapping\n      call table.add_map(from, to)\n    endfor\n  endfor\nendfunction\n\ncommand SkkTechnical call s:eskk_punctuation([[',', '，'], ['.', '．']])\ncommand SkkCasual    call s:eskk_punctuation([[',', '、'], ['.', '。']])\n\n```\n\nでも、実際にはいろいろな種類の文書をひとつの vim で編集したいので、できればバッファごとに設定できると嬉しいです。\n\nよい方法があったらご教示いただけませんでしょうか。  \n（本当は編集中に mode table を交換できればさらに嬉しいですが…）","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"1","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/tyru/eskk.vim|tyru/eskk.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1625828622}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/W2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03455b3f-31c8-4f3a-ba5d-2677b72fae85","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"eskkの拡張が非常に難しくて困ったな","ts":"1625829335.301900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Erq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34fa2a64-5ecb-4750-b345-183fa847a9d2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"VSCode はほんとに楽な実装になっているなあと思います。補完候補を選んだ段階で挿入すべきテキストが存在しない（必ず選択後に確定ボタンを押す必要がある）","ts":"1625824699.301000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XxX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fc07515-bb91-4948-9941-16bba7fd1f55","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"プロトコルと言語ごとの差異のレイヤ分けはわかるけど、もうちょっとどうにかしてほしいですね...","ts":"1625824210.300000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IlW4q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f19d583-ab1b-4497-b21d-f134192df7bc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"_なんで LSP サーバの挙動に関わるものを拡張機能側で設定するのか。。。_","ts":"1625824107.299400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wy3vB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63f693ef-89d4-4866-bf08-eb35e3d81646","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"VSCode はこの「キーワードパターン」に相当するものを拡張機能側で定義できるようにしてるんですよね。","ts":"1625824079.298900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bVrE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34e20b85-8565-4067-88e1-80012b1ede45","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とくに `.` とか `-\u0026gt;` とかを認識しつつスタートにしようとするとつらそうだなあ","ts":"1625824019.298200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8YE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf156018-3577-4270-b8f2-bd5f707c6472","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"この offset を `\\k\\+` で割り出す。というロジックでやるとうまく補完できないことが多い。","ts":"1625823889.297500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XmR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f483d24a-832e-4c6b-b207-f8413bcbd0bf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"厄介なのは大まかに 2 点なんですが、その 2 点が複雑に絡み合ってややこしい実装が必要になっている感じです。\n- LSP には、「キーワードパターン」が定義されていないので、vim でいう `comploete(offset, items)` の offset を「レスポンス受信後」に確定する必要がある\n- LSP の補完は vim でいう `v:completed_item.word` 相当のデータを持たないので、自分で計算して割り出す必要がある","ts":"1625823862.297100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PBnPq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db7d7658-4e84-41ab-b71e-2171330038f0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"英語で長文書くのはつらすぎて困る","ts":"1625823604.295200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EA2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de886dcc-935a-470d-b3cc-d423dcfc2af6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私としても参